env=PS1=$\s
compare=stdout
tr_by=hand
why=after a list the whole prompt (two lines here) and the line are drawn again. The harness reads standard error through a pipe, where the prompt's newline does not return the carriage, so its first drawing is shifted; the editor's redraw goes to the terminal. Screens and transcript written by hand
cols=40
screen=3-3
screen_by=hand
